<li>The Arm-chair at the Inn, Francis Hopkinson Smith, Scribner &amp; Sons, 1912.</li>
<li>A Valiant Gentleman; being the biography of Herbert Ward, artist and man of action, Sarita Ward, Chapman &amp; Hall, 1927.</li>
<li>Herbert Ward: artiste et homme d'action, Sarita Ward, La Revue Mondiale, Paris, 1931.</li>
